1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,432
Hello, I'm Unitree H2. It's great to meet you! Today, I'd like to introduce myself through both speech and movement.

2
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:21,312
I'm bigger than G1, but I'm more than a scaled-up version. My body proportions, joints, and weight are different, so even the same movement calls for different control.

3
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:29,856
With TRACE, I can build on the motion skills SONIC learned on G1, while adapting the control policy to my own body.

4
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:41,900
There's no need to train from scratch. This transfer took about eight hours of training on a single GPU. A new body can still benefit from skills learned before.

5
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:54,324
I can track a wide range of whole-body reference motions, and follow human demonstrations through VR teleoperation. From reaching out to turning around, my whole body works together.

6
00:00:55,340 --> 00:01:08,276
For example, the gestures you're seeing were generated by ECHO-G to accompany my speech. Although these are G1 motion sequences, I can use them directly as references and perform them with my own body.

7
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:18,472
I'm H2. A new body doesn't have to start from zero. It's been great meeting you. See you next time!
